The vector feature libraries in plugins/plasmid/data/features.json and
worker/crates/iki-wasm/data/dna_features.json contain sequence intervals from
public INSDC (GenBank) records. Each interval lists its original accession and
feature location. The database providers impose no restrictions on use or
redistribution. See plugins/plasmid/data/README.md and
https://www.insdc.org/policy/ for the data sources and terms.

